  <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Student Feedback Survey:</h2>
  <p><span data-field="feedback_survey_description">At the end of each term, students enrolled in classes categorized as "lecture," "seminar," or "laboratory" shall be directed to complete an online Student Feedback Survey (SFS). Instructions on how to access the SFS for this course will be sent directly to each student through MavMail approximately 10 days before the end of the term. Each student's feedback enters the SFS database anonymously and is aggregated with that of other students enrolled in the course. UT Arlington's effort to solicit, gather, tabulate, and publish student feedback is required by state law; students are strongly urged to participate. For more information, visit <span data-field="sfs_url">{{ feedback_survey_description">At the end of each term, students enrolled in classes categorized as  }}</span>.</span></p>

